IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g5-interpretation`
IMPORT `g5-nouns`
IMPORT `g5-art13-effects`
IMPORT `g5-art13-reporting`
IMPORT `g5-art14-court-powers`

-- ind-b-tests-fixtures-g5: the fixtures of test author ind-b for Articles 13 and 14 (group G5).  No assertions: the facts here are the scenarios of
-- work/ind-b/expectations.md, put into the shapes of the G5 modules.

§ `ind-b fixtures for Articles 13 and 14`

GIVEN p IS A TYPE
      a IS A TYPE
      d IS A DEONTIC p a
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b5 nothing is owed under` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`ind-b5 A` MEANS `the favoured interpretation of Articles 13 and 14`

GIVEN d IS A STRING
      h IS A MAYBE `Head of charitable purpose`
GIVETH A Purpose
`ind-b5 purpose` d h MEANS
    Purpose WITH
        description IS d
        head IS h
        `is purely ancillary or incidental to a charitable purpose of the entity` IS FALSE
        `is advancing a political party or promoting a candidate for election` IS FALSE
        `is advancing a philosophical belief` IS FALSE

GIVEN name IS A STRING
      matters IS A LIST OF `Kind of reportable matter`
GIVETH A Governor
`ind-b5 governor` name matters MEANS
    Governor WITH
        name IS name
        `is a natural person` IS TRUE
        `is resident in Jersey` IS TRUE
        `is itself a Jersey entity by virtue of Article 2(3)(a)` IS FALSE
        `reportable matters` IS matters

GIVEN standing IS A `Standing on the register`
      kind IS A `Kind of entity`
      governors IS A LIST OF Governor
GIVETH AN Entity
`ind-b5 entity` standing kind governors MEANS
    Entity WITH
        name IS "the test charity"
        `standing on the register` IS standing
        `kinds of entity` IS LIST kind
        `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
        governors IS governors
        purposes IS LIST (`ind-b5 purpose` "the advancement of education" (JUST `the advancement of education`))

-- A registered charity: registered on 2019-01-10; deregistered on `dereg` (NOTHING while registered).
GIVEN standing IS A `Standing on the register`
      kind IS A `Kind of entity`
      governors IS A LIST OF Governor
      dereg IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 charity` standing kind governors dereg MEANS
    `Registered charity` WITH
        entity IS `ind-b5 entity` standing kind governors
        `registration number` IS "CH-0001"
        `registered name` IS "The Test Charity"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2019 1 10
        `date deregistered` IS dereg
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "the advancement of education"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "education of children in Jersey"
        `is an organized religious charity` IS FALSE

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a general-section company charity` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `entered in the general section` `a company` EMPTY NOTHING

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a restricted-section company charity` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `entered in the restricted section` `a company` EMPTY NOTHING

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a company charity deregistered on 1 January 2024` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `formerly registered and entered in the historic section` `a company` EMPTY (JUST (YMD 2024 1 1))

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 an 1862 association charity` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `entered in the general section` `an incorporated 1862 association` EMPTY NOTHING

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a fideicommis charity` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `entered in the general section` `the fidéicommissaires of a court-approved fidéicommis` EMPTY NOTHING

GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a charity with a governor who has a reportable matter` MEANS `ind-b5 charity` `entered in the general section` `a company` (LIST (`ind-b5 governor` "G. Brown" (LIST `bankruptcy or other insolvency`))) NOTHING

`ind-b5 today` MEANS YMD 2026 10 27

-- A provision of the constitution letting an amendment add the purposes given; with or without an order of the court under the Loi of 1862 inconsistent with 13(2) or (3).
GIVEN purposes IS A LIST OF Purpose
      order IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Provision about amending purposes`
`ind-b5 provision permitting` purposes order MEANS
    `Provision about amending purposes` WITH
        `forms part of the entity's constitution or constitutional Law` IS TRUE
        `purports to permit an amendment to include any purpose whatever` IS FALSE
        `purposes whose addition or substitution it purports to permit` IS purposes
        `an order of the court under the Loi of 1862 exists, made before or after registration` IS order
        `that order is inconsistent with paragraph (2) or (3) as applied to the provision` IS order

`ind-b5 a non-charitable purpose` MEANS `ind-b5 purpose` "distributing profits to members" NOTHING
`ind-b5 a charitable purpose` MEANS `ind-b5 purpose` "the advancement of animal welfare" (JUST `the advancement of animal welfare`)

GIVEN original IS A BOOLEAN
      ceased IS A BOOLEAN
      permission IS A BOOLEAN
      before IS A BOOLEAN
      different IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Facts about the condition of the restricted section`
`ind-b5 restricted facts` original ceased permission before different MEANS
    `Facts about the condition of the restricted section` WITH
        `meets the condition as to which the Commissioner was satisfied under Article 9(6)(b)` IS original
        `ceased to meet that condition` IS ceased
        `the Commissioner gave permission to remain entered on the basis of a different condition` IS permission
        `that permission was given before the charity ceased to meet the original condition` IS before
        `meets the different condition as specified in the permission` IS different

GIVEN m IS A `Matter to report under Article 13(6)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b5 a general charity must report` m MEANS
    `Art 13(6) the matter falls within the paragraph` `ind-b5 a charity with a governor who has a reportable matter` TRUE TRUE FALSE m

GIVEN m IS A `Matter to report under Article 13(6)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-b5 a restricted charity must report` m MEANS
    `Art 13(6) the matter falls within the paragraph` `ind-b5 a restricted-section company charity` TRUE TRUE FALSE m

`ind-b5 timing` MEANS `Timing of a matter under Article 13(6)` WITH `date of the event or proposal` IS YMD 2026 3 1, `date the charity became aware of the matter` IS YMD 2026 3 1
`ind-b5 a prompt report` MEANS `Report of a matter under Article 13(6)` WITH `date the report was made` IS JUST (YMD 2026 3 2), `the report was made promptly` IS TRUE

GIVEN commissioner IS A BOOLEAN
      body IS A BOOLEAN
      provision IS A `Provision that an Order under Article 13(10) may relieve`
GIVETH AN `Order under Article 13(10)`
`ind-b5 relief order` commissioner body provision MEANS
    `Order under Article 13(10)` WITH
        provision IS provision
        relief IS `relief by disapplication, Article 13(10)(a)`
        `the Minister consulted the Commissioner` IS commissioner
        `the Minister consulted a body appearing to the Minister to be representative of interested registered charities` IS body
        `it appears to the Minister that the description of charity requires relief from the burden of the provision by virtue of the small size, or lack of resources or expertise, of charities of that description` IS TRUE
        `the charity is of the prescribed description` IS TRUE

GIVEN inconsistent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Payment by the charity`
`ind-b5 a payment` inconsistent MEANS
    `Payment by the charity` WITH
        description IS "a fee paid to a governor"
        `date of the payment` IS YMD 2026 5 1
        `statements provided` IS LIST (`Statement of intentions as to payments` WITH `date provided` IS YMD 2025 1 1, `the payment is inconsistent with it` IS inconsistent)

GIVEN misconduct IS A BOOLEAN
      administration IS A BOOLEAN
      necessary IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `What appears to the court under Article 14(1)`
`ind-b5 appears` misconduct administration necessary MEANS
    `What appears to the court under Article 14(1)` WITH
        `the conduct concerns the administration of the charity` IS administration
        `the conduct is misconduct in the ordinary sense` IS misconduct
        `it is necessary or desirable to exercise the power to protect the charity's property or secure its proper application` IS necessary

GIVEN kind IS AN `Order of the court over a charity`
      at IS A `Person at whom an order is directed`
      forbids IS A MAYBE `Action that an order under Article 14(3)(a) forbids`
      responsible IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Order proposed under Article 14(3)`
`ind-b5 order` kind at forbids responsible MEANS
    `Order proposed under Article 14(3)` WITH
        kind IS kind
        `directed at` IS at
        forbids IS forbids
        `it appears to the court that the person at whom the order is directed has engaged in misconduct or is responsible for it` IS responsible
        period IS `an indefinite period` (YMD 2026 1 1)

-- A general-section company charity registered on 29 February 2020 (for F5.11).
GIVETH A `Registered charity`
`ind-b5 a charity registered on 29 February 2020` MEANS
    `Registered charity` WITH
        entity IS `ind-b5 entity` `entered in the general section` `a company` EMPTY
        `registration number` IS "CH-0229"
        `registered name` IS "The Leap Charity"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2020 2 29
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "the advancement of education"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "education of children in Jersey"
        `is an organized religious charity` IS FALSE

-- A matter: the event on 2026-03-01, the charity aware on 2026-03-05.
`ind-b5 timing with late awareness` MEANS `Timing of a matter under Article 13(6)` WITH `date of the event or proposal` IS YMD 2026 3 1, `date the charity became aware of the matter` IS YMD 2026 3 5

GIVEN made IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Report of a matter under Article 13(6)`
`ind-b5 a report made on` made MEANS `Report of a matter under Article 13(6)` WITH `date the report was made` IS JUST made, `the report was made promptly` IS FALSE
